{"seq":3,"slug":"dark-matter-halo","title":"暗物质晕","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/milky-way-structure/dark-matter-halo","wordCount":2252,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"暗物质晕\">暗物质晕</h1><p>银河系的暗物质晕（Dark Matter Halo）是一个近似球对称的巨大不可见质量结构，其半径延伸至约 200-300 kpc，质量约为 1-2 × 10¹² M☉，远超银河系中可见物质（恒星 + 气体 + 尘埃）的总质量。暗物质晕的存在是 20 世纪天文学最深刻的发现之一，对理解星系形成、宇宙结构演化以及基本粒子物理都具有根本意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>暗物质晕的研究可以归结为四个层层递进的概念。第一是<strong>存在性证据</strong>：旋转曲线的平坦化、卫星星系运动学和恒星流动力学都表明，在可见物质之外必须存在大量不可见质量，且其累积质量近似正比于半径。第二是<strong>密度剖面</strong>：宇宙学 N 体模拟预言暗物质晕遵循 NFW 剖面 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho(r) = \\rho_s / [(r/r_s)(1+r/r_s)^2]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">[(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，其中心呈尖角（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\propto r^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）、外围快速衰减（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\propto r^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），用一个尺度半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和集中度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 就能概括晕的整体形态。第三是<strong>中心密度之争</strong>——即&quot;核心-尖角问题&quot;：观测到的矮星系旋转曲线似乎偏好平坦核心，与 NFW 的尖角预言存在张力，可能的解决途径包括重子物理反馈、自相互作用暗物质和暖暗物质。第四是<strong>亚结构</strong>：ΛCDM 预言晕内应包含大量子晕，而观测到的卫星星系数量远少于此（&quot;缺失卫星问题&quot;），恒星流中的密度间隙则提供了探测暗子晕的间接手段。</p>\n<p>太阳邻域的局部暗物质密度（共识值约 0.4 GeV/cm³）把这些结构概念与地面直接探测实验直接联系起来——它决定了探测器的预期事件率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"观测证据\">观测证据</h2><h3 id=\"旋转曲线\">旋转曲线</h3><p>银河系旋转曲线（Rotation Curve）是暗物质存在的最直接证据之一。如果银河系质量全部集中在可见物质中，预期在可见物质边缘外围圆速度应按开普勒定律下降（V ∝ R⁻¹/²）。然而观测表明：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>半径区域</th>\n<th>预期行为（纯可见物质）</th>\n<th>实际观测</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>R &lt; 3 kpc</td>\n<td>刚体旋转 V ∝ R</td>\n<td>基本一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3-8 kpc</td>\n<td>峰值后下降</td>\n<td>近似平坦 ~220-240 km/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8-25 kpc</td>\n<td>开普勒下降 V ∝ R⁻⁰·⁵</td>\n<td>保持平坦或微升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 25 kpc</td>\n<td>快速下降</td>\n<td>仍接近平坦（卫星星系约束）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这种&quot;平坦旋转曲线&quot;要求在可见物质之外存在大量不可见质量，其密度分布使得在任意半径 R 内的累积质量近似正比于 R。</p>\n<h3 id=\"卫星星系运动学\">卫星星系运动学</h3><p>银河系拥有约 60 个已知卫星星系（包括大小麦哲伦云、人马座矮星系等）。这些卫星星系的轨道速度和空间分布提供了大尺度暗物质晕质量的独立约束：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 银河系暗物质晕质量测量方法&#10;        A[旋转曲线 R&lt;25 kpc] --&gt; E[综合约束]&#10;        B[卫星星系运动学] --&gt; E&#10;        C[恒星流动力学] --&gt; E&#10;        D[逃逸速度测量] --&gt; E&#10;        E --&gt; F[M_200 ≈ 1.0-1.5 × 10^12 M☉]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 银河系暗物质晕质量测量方法\n        A[旋转曲线 R&lt;25 kpc] --&gt; E[综合约束]\n        B[卫星星系运动学] --&gt; E\n        C[恒星流动力学] --&gt; E\n        D[逃逸速度测量] --&gt; E\n        E --&gt; F[M_200 ≈ 1.0-1.5 × 10^12 M☉]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"恒星流\">恒星流</h3><p>矮星系被银河系潮汐撕裂后形成细长的恒星流（Stellar Streams），其轨道形态对暗物质晕的引力势高度敏感。已知的主要恒星流包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>恒星流</th>\n<th>前身天体</th>\n<th>长度</th>\n<th>约束能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人马座流</td>\n<td>人马座矮椭球星系</td>\n<td>全天环绕</td>\n<td>晕形状（三轴性）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GD-1</td>\n<td>球状星团（已瓦解）</td>\n<td>~80°</td>\n<td>局部暗物质密度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Palomar 5 流</td>\n<td>Pal 5 球状星团</td>\n<td>~20°</td>\n<td>暗物质子结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Orphan-Chenab</td>\n<td>未知</td>\n<td>~210°</td>\n<td>大尺度晕质量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Gaia 卫星数据已揭示数十条新恒星流，极大丰富了约束暗物质晕结构的动力学示踪样本。</p>\n<h3 id=\"逃逸速度\">逃逸速度</h3><p>太阳邻域的逃逸速度（约 530-580 km/s，基于 Gaia DR3 高速恒星样本）约束了银河系从太阳位置到无穷远的总引力势，因而对晕的总质量提供上界约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"暗物质晕密度剖面\">暗物质晕密度剖面</h2><h3 id=\"nfw-剖面\">NFW 剖面</h3><p>宇宙学 N 体模拟（如 Millennium, Bolshoi, IllustrisTNG）预言暗物质晕的密度分布遵循 Navarro-Frenk-White（NFW）剖面：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho(r) = \\frac{\\rho_s}{(r/r_s)(1 + r/r_s)^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0436em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为特征尺度半径，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为特征密度。NFW 剖面的两个关键特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区域</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>物理含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>r ≪ r_s</td>\n<td>ρ ∝ r⁻¹（尖角）</td>\n<td>中心密度发散（cusp）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>r ≫ r_s</td>\n<td>ρ ∝ r⁻³</td>\n<td>外围快速衰减</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>银河系的 NFW 参数估计：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>估计值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>维里质量 M₂₀₀</td>\n<td>~1.0-1.5 × 10¹² M☉</td>\n<td>200 倍临界密度球内总质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维里半径 R₂₀₀</td>\n<td>~200-250 kpc</td>\n<td>维里质量对应半径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集中度参数 c</td>\n<td>~10-15</td>\n<td>c = R₂₀₀/r_s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征半径 r_s</td>\n<td>~15-25 kpc</td>\n<td>斜率转折半径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"核心-尖角问题\">核心-尖角问题</h3><p>观测（特别是矮星系旋转曲线）显示暗物质中心密度分布可能比 NFW 预言的尖角（Cusp）更为平坦，形成恒定密度核心（Core）。这一&quot;核心-尖角问题&quot;（Core-Cusp Problem）是 ΛCDM 模型的经典小尺度挑战之一：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 核心-尖角问题的解决方案&#10;        A[重子物理反馈] --&gt; D[可能解决]&#10;        B[自相互作用暗物质 SIDM] --&gt; D&#10;        C[暖暗物质 WDM] --&gt; D&#10;        D --&gt; E[修改中心密度分布]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 核心-尖角问题的解决方案\n        A[重子物理反馈] --&gt; D[可能解决]\n        B[自相互作用暗物质 SIDM] --&gt; D\n        C[暖暗物质 WDM] --&gt; D\n        D --&gt; E[修改中心密度分布]\n    end</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>重子物理反馈</strong>：超新星爆发和恒星风驱动的气体外流可反复改变中心引力势，通过动力学加热将尖角转化为核心</li>\n<li><strong>自相互作用暗物质（SIDM）</strong>：暗物质粒子间的散射可在中心区域建立热平衡，产生等温核心</li>\n<li><strong>暖暗物质（WDM）</strong>：较大的自由流长度自然抑制小尺度结构</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"太阳邻域暗物质密度\">太阳邻域暗物质密度</h2><p>太阳位置处的局部暗物质密度是地面直接探测实验灵敏度的关键参数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测量方法</th>\n<th>局部密度估计 ρ₀</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>垂直运动学（Jeans 分析）</td>\n<td>0.3-0.5 GeV/cm³</td>\n<td>银盘附近恒星垂直振荡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>旋转曲线分解</td>\n<td>0.3-0.4 GeV/cm³</td>\n<td>盘+核球+晕模型拟合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局质量建模</td>\n<td>0.4-0.5 GeV/cm³</td>\n<td>多约束联合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共识值</td>\n<td>~0.4 GeV/cm³ ≈ 0.01 M☉/pc³</td>\n<td>用于直接探测实验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>该密度意味着以 ~220 km/s 运动的暗物质粒子流（相对于太阳的银河系静止系速度）穿过地球，构成直接探测的信号源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"暗物质晕的亚结构\">暗物质晕的亚结构</h2><p>ΛCDM 宇宙学预言暗物质晕并非光滑球体，而是包含大量自相似的子晕（Subhalos）——这些是被主晕吞并但尚未完全潮汐瓦解的小型暗物质结构：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>预测</th>\n<th>ΛCDM 预言</th>\n<th>观测</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>卫星子晕数量（M &gt; 10⁷ M☉）</td>\n<td>~数百</td>\n<td>~60 已知卫星星系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暗子晕（无恒星）</td>\n<td>~数千</td>\n<td>恒星流间隙间接探测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子晕质量函数斜率</td>\n<td>dN/dM ∝ M⁻¹·⁹</td>\n<td>待验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&quot;缺失卫星问题&quot;（Missing Satellites Problem）——即预言子晕数量远多于观测到的卫星星系——目前通过以下途径部分解决：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>微弱卫星星系的持续发现（DES, LSST 深度巡天）</li>\n<li>重子物理抑制低质量子晕中的恒星形成（再电离、超新星反馈）</li>\n<li>观测不完备性修正</li>\n</ul>\n<p>恒星流中的密度间隙（Gaps）是探测暗子晕的有力工具：暗子晕穿过恒星流时会留下引力扰动痕迹，即使子晕中无恒星也可间接检测其存在。GD-1 流中已观测到若干间隙结构，可能暗示暗子晕的存在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"暗物质探测实验\">暗物质探测实验</h2><h3 id=\"直接探测\">直接探测</h3><p>地下实验试图探测暗物质粒子与原子核的稀有散射事件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实验</th>\n<th>靶材料</th>\n<th>最强约束（截面上限）</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LZ（LUX-ZEPLIN）</td>\n<td>液氙 10 ton</td>\n<td>~10⁻⁴⁸ cm²（40 GeV）</td>\n<td>运行中（2022-）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>XENONnT</td>\n<td>液氙 8.6 ton</td>\n<td>~10⁻⁴⁸ cm²</td>\n<td>运行中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PandaX-4T</td>\n<td>液氙 4 ton</td>\n<td>~10⁻⁴⁷ cm²</td>\n<td>运行中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DARWIN/XLZD</td>\n<td>液氙 50 ton</td>\n<td>目标 ~10⁻⁴⁹ cm²</td>\n<td>规划中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"间接探测\">间接探测</h3><p>搜索暗物质湮灭或衰变产物（γ 射线、正电子、中微子）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>来源方向</th>\n<th>探测器</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>γ 射线连续谱</td>\n<td>银心、矮星系</td>\n<td>Fermi-LAT, CTA</td>\n<td>CTA 建设中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正电子超出</td>\n<td>全天</td>\n<td>AMS-02</td>\n<td>来源争议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高能中微子</td>\n<td>银心、太阳</td>\n<td>IceCube</td>\n<td>无显著信号</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"粒子对撞机\">粒子对撞机</h3><p>LHC 搜索暗物质产生事件（缺失横动量信号）：目前未发现超出标准模型预言的信号，对 WIMP 暗物质在 TeV 尺度的质量-耦合参数空间施加强约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"银河系暗物质晕参数总结\">银河系暗物质晕参数总结</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>最佳估计</th>\n<th>不确定度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>总维里质量 M₂₀₀</td>\n<td>1.0-1.5 × 10¹² M☉</td>\n<td>±30%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维里半径 R₂₀₀</td>\n<td>~200-250 kpc</td>\n<td>±20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暗物质占总质量比</td>\n<td>~85-90%</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>局部密度 ρ₀</td>\n<td>~0.4 GeV/cm³</td>\n<td>±30%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>晕形状</td>\n<td>近球或微三轴（q ~ 0.8-1.0）</td>\n<td>取决于半径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暗物质粒子本质</td>\n<td>未知（WIMP? Axion?）</td>\n<td>世纪难题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>暗物质晕的研究处于天文学与粒子物理学的交叉前沿。未来十年，LSST 的深度巡天将发现数百颗超微弱卫星星系和恒星流，Vera C. Rubin 天文台有望将缺失卫星问题转化为对暗物质粒子性质的精确约束；与此同时，下一代直接探测实验（XLZD/DARWIN）将探索中微子地板附近的参数空间，逼近 WIMP 探测的最终灵敏度极限。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"暗物质晕","id":"暗物质晕"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"观测证据","id":"观测证据"},{"level":3,"text":"旋转曲线","id":"旋转曲线"},{"level":3,"text":"卫星星系运动学","id":"卫星星系运动学"},{"level":3,"text":"恒星流","id":"恒星流"},{"level":3,"text":"逃逸速度","id":"逃逸速度"},{"level":2,"text":"暗物质晕密度剖面","id":"暗物质晕密度剖面"},{"level":3,"text":"NFW 剖面","id":"nfw-剖面"},{"level":3,"text":"核心-尖角问题","id":"核心-尖角问题"},{"level":2,"text":"太阳邻域暗物质密度","id":"太阳邻域暗物质密度"},{"level":2,"text":"暗物质晕的亚结构","id":"暗物质晕的亚结构"},{"level":2,"text":"暗物质探测实验","id":"暗物质探测实验"},{"level":3,"text":"直接探测","id":"直接探测"},{"level":3,"text":"间接探测","id":"间接探测"},{"level":3,"text":"粒子对撞机","id":"粒子对撞机"},{"level":2,"text":"银河系暗物质晕参数总结","id":"银河系暗物质晕参数总结"}],"prev":{"title":"银河系中心与 Sgr A\\*","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/milky-way-structure/galactic-center"},"next":{"title":"哈勃序列与形态分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/galaxy-classification-evolution/hubble-sequence"}}